{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>The dowry of virgins.</b> Rabbi Yehudah HaChasid said: from here is a hint that a virgin's ketubah is two hundred, for it is written כמהר הבתולות — defective, and it is a notarikon: כמה מהר הבתולות ר [=200]. And R. Moshe said: כי כמהר has the numerical value of two hundred zuz plus one, and there is a basis in the reading."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:52.223742909Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}